# Molten Exhale at instant speed owes its behold (CR 601.2b, 701.4a, 118.8). On turn 4 Bot2 casts Lightning Bolt at Bot1, and
# Bot1, holding up Mox Ruby and Mox Emerald with a Phyrexian Dragon Engine on the battlefield, casts the Exhale over it for {1}{R}:
# nothing is asked about the extra but the Dragon chosen (beholding moves nothing: the Engine stays untapped on the battlefield).
# It resolves before the Bolt: Bot2's Ornithopter dies, and the Bolt then takes Bot1 to 17.

